From: S10+ port contributors
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Guard and bound Android SDK32 autosuspend activation

Apply after unchanged upstream d87b745 on installed-source 3657516.
No forceSuspend or sysfs writes. Activation failure keeps existing guard only
while this client and HAL remain alive; later acquire failures are explicit.

